@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Get all games for a team
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/GetTeamGames?TeamName=radicals

### Missing team name returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/GetTeamGames

### Invalid team name format returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/GetTeamGames?TeamName=Radicals!

### Preview historical event ordering without changing the live event stream
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/ordering-preview?gameId=2026-07-10-PIT-MAD

### Missing game ID returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/ordering-preview
